The RC204 ZigBee Mini Remote Control provides up to 4 on/off dimming controls with lights status feedback, all-lights-on and all-lights-off functions.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA1.2 compliant, ZigBee ZLL compliant
- Up to 4 on/off dimming control
- Lights status feedback
- All-lights-on, all-lights-off
- Rechargeable battery backup
- Power saving mode and auto wake-up
- Mini size (17 x 45 x 129 mm, 51g)
